{
  "name": "theta-h1-implied-features-ic-validation",
  "notes": "PRE-REGISTERED H1 (ADR-0265, Amendment 5), validation period 2021-01-04 .. 2026-01-01 (end_before; nothing on or after 2026-01-01 is read). ADR RULE, verbatim: **H1** option-implied features → next 5- and 21-day stock return: 25-delta put-call IV spread, risk-reversal skew, 30/90-day term slope, open-interest put/call ratio and its 5-day change, volume/OI. Per-stamp Spearman IC, sign declared per feature before the run, NW t >= 2.5; decile spread > 10 bp round trip; BH across the 6 features. COMMON (ADR-0265 decisions 1-4): Split. Development 2016-01-04..2020-12-31; validation 2021-01-04..2025-12-31, run once per hypothesis, unchanged, only if the development run passed; 2024-25 is a labelled subperiod, never the sole basis of a pass; 2026 stays sealed. Universe gate: a root enters a test only from its first date with bid > 0 (the census); roots are stitched across renames. Cost model: buy at the ask, sell at the bid (NBBO); no mid fills; `close` is never a mark; our own Black-76 implied vol from the mid and the parity forward. Multiple testing: Benjamini-Hochberg 5% within a hypothesis's feature family; Bonferroni across the families for any headline claim; secondary analyses are reported, never promoted. RUN ONCE: this is the validation run; it is not repeated, tuned or re-read. Run from children/index_options, niced, after the census, the universe freeze and the panel (ADR-0265 Amendment 5 run book): nice -n 10 python -m dskit.pipeline run configs/run-theta-h1-implied-features-ic-validation.json --asof 2025-12-31",
  "outputs": {
    "run_root": "/home/russell/data/index_options/theta-research-20261012/hypotheses/h1-implied-features-ic-validation",
    "notes": "Beside the other research runs; nothing is written under /home/russell/data/thetadata. Excluded from the identity hash."
  },
  "pipeline": {
    "panel": {
      "uses": "dskit.pipeline.libs.parquet:ParquetStreamRows",
      "params": {
